<title>POLAND: POLISH CENTRAL BANK ZLOTY FIXINGS FOR TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>POLISH CENTRAL BANK ZLOTY FIXINGS FOR TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland was unable to announce its daily zloty fixings on the page due to technical problems.</p>
<p>Following are zloty rates set by the NBP for Tuesday:</p>
